      "ordinal": 0,
      "title": "KAFKA-20397: Review to improve metadata error check before blocking on buffer data in consumer",
      "text": "The async consumer checks and throws metadata errors on poll from checkInflightPoll. Later on (after checking if there is data already buffered), it may block waiting on buffer data. If the background thread finds a metadata error in the meantime, it is not thrown until the wait ends.",
